OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMost showers
OL,6,Ftending to die out through the evening
OL,7,Fand although cloudy at first, clear
OL,8,Fspells developing later with lighter
OL,9,Fwesterly winds. The odd shower will
OL,10,Fcontinue over the Trossachs and
OL,11,Fwestern Perthshire.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA bright start on Wednesday
OL,14,Fbut some showers developing in the
OL,15,Fafternoon and evening, a few showers
OL,16,Fturning heavy, with some thunder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
